{"id": "37089", "title": "坏当家", "author": "决明", "category": "文学名著", "count": 22, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37089.htm", "intro": "她是一个坏当家。\r\n每一个认识她的人，都不会否认这句话\r\n她可以因为妒忌，就把情如姊妹的冰心卖给富豪当小妾\r\n她可以因为贪财，天价卖出亲如家人的玉鉴师公孙谦\r\n她更可以因为怨恨，不许人救治性命垂危的“假春儿”！\r\n对于旁人的想法和批评，其实她并不怎么在意\r\n即使是她用尽了全部心思爱著的夏侯武威\r\n她也不会在他面前多解释一句！\r\n他认定她是个坏姑娘又如何？\r\n他眼里的她冷血冷漠、铁石心肠、心如蛇蝎又怎样？\r\n反正他从头到尾都没有爱过她\r\n反正他对她好都是为了某个目的\r\n那么，她宁愿把那些最最细腻的玲珑心思藏在心底\r\n就算有委屈、就算有眼泪，也不给任何人看见…", "base": "files/article/html/37/37089", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2909877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(1)", "file": "2909878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1章(2)", "file": "2909879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(1)", "file": "2909880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章(2)", "file": "2909881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(1)", "file": "2909882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章(2)", "file": "2909883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(1)", "file": "2909884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章(2)", "file": "2909885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(1)", "file": "2909886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章(2)", "file": "2909887.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(1)", "file": "2909888.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第6章(2)", "file": "2909889.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(1)", "file": "2909890.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第7章(2)", "file": "2909891.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(1)", "file": "2909892.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第8章(2)", "file": "2909893.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(1)", "file": "2909894.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第9章(2)", "file": "2909895.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(1)", "file": "2909896.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章(2)", "file": "2909897.html", "available": true}, {"title": "尾声", "file": "2909898.html", "available": true}]}